{"symbol":"AIKPIPES","yahoo":"AIKPIPES.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"AIK Pipes and Polymers Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","website":"https://www.aikpipes.com","about":"AIK Pipes and Polymers Limited manufactures and sells pipes in India. It provides high-density polyethylene (HDPE) pipes; medium density polyethylene (MDPE) pipes, polypropylene random (PPR) pipes, pressure pipes, and fabricated and injected butt-welding products; male and female couplers, plastic clamp clamps, tees, bends, connectors, reducers, saddle, quick connect end cap, and service saddles; oil and gas pipes; and telecom ducts. It offers its products for the use in the water distribution, gas transmission, sewerage system, and telecommunication sectors under the AIK brand name. The company also provides drip irrigation systems, mini sprinklers, and farmer-focused water management solutions under the BANAS brand name. AIK Pipes and Polymers Limited was incorporated in 2017 and is based in Jaipur, India.","updated":"2026-09-29T11:56:53+00:00","quote":{"price":27.0,"prevClose":27.0,"marketCap":17.18,"high52":65.95,"low52":19.02,"pe":192.86,"bookValue":36.02,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":0.38,"shares":0.6363,"insiders":73.5,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-01-02","2024-01-03","2024-01-04","2024-01-05","2024-01-08","2024-01-09","2024-01-10","2024-01-11","2024-01-12","2024-01-15","2024-01-16","2024-01-17","2024-01-18","2024-01-19","2024-01-23","2024-01-24","2024-01-25","2024-01-29","2024-01-30","2024-01-31","2024-02-01","2024-02-02","2024-02-05","2024-02-06","2024-02-07","2024-02-08","2024-02-09","2024-02-12","2024-02-13","2024-02-14","2024-02-15","2024-02-16","2024-02-19","2024-02-20","2024-02-21","2024-02-22","2024-02-23","2024-02-26","2024-02-27","2024-02-28","2024-02-29","2024-03-01","2024-03-04","2024-03-05","2024-03-06","2024-03-07","2024-03-11","2024-03-12","2024-03-13","2024-03-14","2024-03-18","2024-03-19","2024-03-20","2024-